      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "This seems backwards to me: the risk of a mistake here is that the block becomes invalid losing all possible reward from mining it, while the benefit of success is perhaps a single larger / additional transaction at the bottom of the block. Currently the bottom transaction in a block seems to pay less than 1000sats in total fees, so generously, that's less than 80c per block, as compared to the subsidy of around $240k per block.",
